{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Strategy Game, Not Action Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369780/extras/9db5a467d0d842773b1c26b4613b02ff.avif?t=1750504623\" data-has-big width=800 height=422 /></span>The game supports up to few thousands of units on the battlefield. Therefore, you must focus on thoughtful planning and strategic placement of your armies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Individual units micromanagement is avoided wherever possible. Units have no user-activated skills. Just attack-move or leave them alone, and the units will do the best, on their own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also ensure protection of your supply lines.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Any-Shape 3D Maps</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369780/extras/440ad730b3a098ebc35f3a4a05577171.poster.avif?t=1750504623\" width=800 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369780/extras/440ad730b3a098ebc35f3a4a05577171.webm?t=1750504623\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Play on the surface of any 3D shape, such as a planet, potato, horseshoe, or gear. Perhaps several islands floating in void connected with small bridges. Perhaps a stuck clockwork.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most places can be ambushed from many directions. Units may shoot across void, if visible and in range.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Determining the strategic value of various positions on the map is a crucial skill to master the game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Resources In The World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369780/extras/76469a4d14637c27d977f817fc13ec4b.avif?t=1750504623\" data-has-big width=800 height=390 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is over a dozen types of resources: raw ores, intermediate goods, and military parts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All resources are on pallets or in boxes, existing directly in the world, and requiring transportation. Trucks are controlled automatically.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UW has no technology tree or research. Progression is achieved through acquiring or refining new resources.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2369780?t=1750504623","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2369780?t=1750504623","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369780/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750504623","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369780/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750504623","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Tracked Controller Support","id":52},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62},{"description":"Steam Timeline","id":63}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Tanks shooting at each other, at buildings, and blowing things off."},"demos":[{"appid":3132060,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Strategy Game, Not Action Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369780/extras/9db5a467d0d842773b1c26b4613b02ff.avif?t=1750504623\" data-has-big width=800 height=422 /></span>The game supports up to few thousands of units on the battlefield. Therefore, you must focus on thoughtful planning and strategic placement of your armies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Individual units micromanagement is avoided wherever possible. Units have no user-activated skills. Just attack-move or leave them alone, and the units will do the best, on their own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also ensure protection of your supply lines.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Any-Shape 3D Maps</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369780/extras/440ad730b3a098ebc35f3a4a05577171.poster.avif?t=1750504623\" width=800 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369780/extras/440ad730b3a098ebc35f3a4a05577171.webm?t=1750504623\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Play on the surface of any 3D shape, such as a planet, potato, horseshoe, or gear. Perhaps several islands floating in void connected with small bridges. Perhaps a stuck clockwork.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most places can be ambushed from many directions. Units may shoot across void, if visible and in range.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Determining the strategic value of various positions on the map is a crucial skill to master the game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Resources In The World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369780/extras/76469a4d14637c27d977f817fc13ec4b.avif?t=1750504623\" data-has-big width=800 height=390 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is over a dozen types of resources: raw ores, intermediate goods, and military parts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All resources are on pallets or in boxes, existing directly in the world, and requiring transportation. Trucks are controlled automatically.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UW has no technology tree or research. Progression is achieved through acquiring or refining new resources.</p>","developers":["Tom\u00e1\u0161 Mal\u00fd"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369780/header.jpg?t=1750504623","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 24<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> x64, 4 threads<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 4.5, vram 4 GB<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 15 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> <br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Linux support is experimental</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 24<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> x64, 8 threads<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 4.5, vram 6 GB<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 15 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Linux support is experimental</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2369780/791821/5203b780dcbee52d63440c42eaa08a0774b115f6/1750911945/dash_av1.mpd?t=1732713284","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2369780/791821/5203b780dcbee52d63440c42eaa08a0774b115f6/1750911945/dash_h264.mpd?t=1732713284","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.aka