 of any 3D shape. It emphasizes base building and logistics, careful planning, and minimizes micro-management of units.","steam_appid":2369780,"support_info":{"email":"support@unnaturalworlds.com","url":"https://github.com/unnatural-worlds/public-issue-tracker"},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong>, Czech<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":"https://unnaturalworlds.com/"}